# Live deployment modules. A deployment module states current standings and
# where the alliance actually lives, and this repo is public — so operational
# ones go here and are never committed. Activate one the usual way
# (DEPLOYMENT=<name>); the loader checks private/ before deployments/.
# Reaches a server as a mounted volume, not via git — see tools/push-deployment.sh.
private/
# Belt and braces: catches an operational module dropped in deployments/ by
# habit or by the bootstrap's default --output.
deployments/local_*.py

